<view class="container nav-safe evidence-page"><view class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE · TRACEABLE JUDGEMENT</view><view class="title page-title">判断依据</view><view class="subtitle">把“哪里会受影响”拆成可复核的观测证据与推演逻辑。</view><view class="answer-card card-dark"><view class="row"><view class="answer-kicker">综合判断</view><text class="tag confidence-tag">可信度较高</text></view><view class="answer-title">东湖高新区最先进入强回波影响窗口。</view><view class="answer-copy">主回波正在增强，且整体向东南移动；未来 60 分钟，东湖高新区超阈值概率约 83%，天河机场约 68%。建议先关注东南方向的户外作业与交通窗口。</view><view class="answer-foot"><text>雷达 + 卫星 + 轨迹</text><text>更新于 12:10</text></view></view><view class="section-title section-gap">三类核心证据</view><view class="basis-list"><block wx:for="{{basis}}" wx:key="title"><view class="basis-item card"><view class="basis-icon">{{item.icon}}</view><view class="basis-copy"><view class="row"><text class="basis-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="basis-value">{{item.value}}</text></view><text class="basis-detail">{{item.detail}}</text></view></view></block></view><view class="section-title section-gap">从证据到判断</view><view class="logic-card card"><view class="logic-step"><view class="step-num">1</view><view><text class="step-title">识别强回波对象</text><text class="step-copy">在历史 VIL 场中提取 VIL ≥ 32 的连续区域。</text></view></view><view class="logic-line"></view><view class="logic-step"><view class="step-num">2</view><view><text class="step-title">估计移动方向</text><text class="step-copy">用相邻帧质心匹配，判断对象是否朝目标区域移动。</text></view></view><view class="logic-line"></view><view class="logic-step"><view class="step-num">3</view><view><text class="step-title">汇总未来概率</text><text class="step-copy">将预测集合转成区域级超阈值概率，并按场景给出行动提示。</text></view></view></view><view class="limitations card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title small-title">使用边界</text><text class="link" bindtap="toggle">{{expanded ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text></view><view class="limitation-copy"><text>• 当前为 synthetic_demo 合成演示，不是实时预警。</text><text>• VIL 是强回波变量，不等同于降雨量或地面积水。</text><text>• 区域坐标为网格映射，正式部署需接入经纬度投影。</text><text wx:if="{{expanded}}">• 机场、交通、防汛和大型活动场景仍需结合各自阈值与人工值守。</text></view></view></view>
